// self-hosted::ir::reach_probe_runner
//
// Probe: parse a .sio source, lower to IR, run reach_thin_module(), and
// report how many functions survive the reachability filter from main().
//
// Imports the same symbol set as wide_native_compile_driver.sio so that
// souc check can resolve all references in the ir::lower dependency chain.
// At RUNTIME, only the parse → summary → body-lower → reachability path
// is executed — no codegen functions are called, so JIT footprint stays
// bounded (same as native_compile_driver.sio's lowering phase).
//
// Usage:
//   souc run self-hosted/ir/reach_probe_runner.sio -- <source.sio>
//
// Output:
//   reach_probe: source=<path>
//   reach_probe: fn_count=<N>
//   reach_probe: reachable=<R> eliminated=<E> total=<N>
//   reach_probe: thin_ratio=<R>/<N>
//
// Sprint 131: reachability probe for self-hosted bootstrap sizing.

